 756:C:/Program Files (x86)/Arm GNU Toolchain arm-none-eabi/14.3 rel1/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/14.3.1/bits\stl_deque.h ****    *    - i.last  == i.first + node_size
 757:C:/Program Files (x86)/Arm GNU Toolchain arm-none-eabi/14.3 rel1/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/14.3.1/bits\stl_deque.h ****    *    - i.cur is a pointer in the range [i.first, i.last).  NOTE:
